ddle East geopolitical tensions continued to disrupt LPG supply flows. The expiration of","x":86.18,"y":759.6,"width":436.78},{"page":6,"text":"the US-Iran 60-day ceasefire deal without a breakthrough on August 18 triggered a sharp","x":86.18,"y":745.06,"width":437},{"page":6,"text":"spike in crude and LPG prices, while vessel crossings through the Strait remained below","x":86.18,"y":730.54,"width":437.29},{"page":6,"text":"normal levels. Middle East LPG exports were projected at around 1.1 million mt in August,","x":86.18,"y":715.9,"width":437},{"page":6,"text":"approximately 30% below July's 1.6 million mt, due to limited tanker participation.","x":86.18,"y":701.38,"width":393.72},{"page":6,"text":"c)","x":72.02,"y":686.86,"width":9.2},{"page":6,"text":"Asian LPG demand firmed ahead of winter, which were supported by higher Chinese PDH","x":86.18,"y":686.86,"width":437.17},{"page":6,"text":"utilization and a 73% month-on-month increase in China's LPG imports. Indian buyers also","x":86.18,"y":672.34,"width":437.16},{"page":6,"text":"resumed spot procurement.","x":86.18,"y":657.7,"width":134.48},{"page":6,"text":"d)","x":72.02,"y":643.18,"width":9.8},{"page":6,"text":"Shipping and supply constraints persisted, as Saudi Arabia shifted LPG shipments toward","x":86.18,"y":643.18,"width":437.06},{"page":6,"text":"Red Sea ports and relied on shuttle and ship-to-ship operations to maintain cargo flows.","x":86.18,"y":628.66,"width":426.85},{"page":6,"text":"2026.","x":72.02,"y":518.71,"width":27.55},{"page":6,"text":"Enforcement and Compliance","x":72.02,"y":481.63,"width":155.4},{"page":6,"text":"non-compliance are encouraged to report the matter to FCCC.","x":72.02,"y":353.33,"width":318.07},{"page":6,"text":"The Central team can be","x":394.87,"y":353.33,"width":128.63},{"page":6,"text":"Complaints can be","x":430.99,"y":309.65,"width":92.66},{"page":6,"text":"emailed to","x":72.02,"y":295.01,"width":50.88},{"page":6,"text":"helpdesk@fccc.gov.fj","x":125.9,"y":295.01,"width":103.36},{"page":6,"text":", or lodged through the FCCC website at","x":229.25,"y":295.01,"width":196.79},{"page":6,"text":"www.fccc.gov.fj","x":429.19,"y":295.01,"width":74.42},{"page":6,"text":".","x":503.62,"y":295.01,"width":3.07},{"page":6,"text":"throughout November.","x":72.02,"y":247.37,"width":108.9},{"page":6,"text":"- Ends -","x":277.49,"y":228.89,"width":40.4}]